=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Ploh Trishbahk} (K-9) in {z:Eastern Adoulin} to receive a list of required items.
* Speak to {n:Rigobertine} in the south-east corner of (J-7) (the northern alley from the **Coronal Esplanade**) in {z:Eastern Adoulin} to receive the {@k} {p:Eternal flame} and hints about the other items.
** You cannot obtain the other items without this cutscene.
* Go to **Platea Triumphus** in {z:Western Adoulin} and click the spot marked **Fontis Xanira** (its the water fountain at H-8/9 border) to receive the {@k} {k:Vial of untainted holy water}.
* Go to the {z:Western Adoulin} **Waterfront** (J-4) and click on the spot called **Sunrise Beacon** on the tower to receive the {@k} {k:Piece of a stone wall}.
* Speak to {n:Erminold} at (J-10) near **Castle Adoulin Gates** in {z:Eastern Adoulin} to obtain the {@k} {k:Weather vane wings}.
** This will always be the last one you obtain; while the second and third can be obtained in either order, you need both to get this one.
* After obtaining the 4 Key Items you will be on the next Mission: {M:The Purgation|The Purgation|The Purgation}.

